### Performance Engineering

Implement:

1. Optimized database queries.
2. Appropriate database indexes.
3. Server-side pagination.
4. Lazy loading for non-critical content.
5. API response optimization.
6. Efficient frontend rendering.
7. Debounced search.
8. Caching for appropriate read-only data.
9. Optimized chart rendering.
10. Background processing for heavy jobs.
11. Avoid unnecessary API calls.
12. Avoid duplicate requests.
